Usage: tool scan PRODUCT [OPTIONS]
      --exclude=NAME,NAME2            Exclude repositories
      --public-only                   Searches only public repositories
  -u, --user=NAME                     Sets the user

Other:
      --max-eol-days-away NUMBER      Sets the maximum number of days away
  -h, --help                          Show this help message
